crates/asterism-ui/dist/
crates/asterism-ui/gen/
.mcp.json

# Coexisting AI CLI scratch (codex CLI local state / AGENTS.md sidecar)
.codex/
AGENTS.md

logs

# `just check` transcripts, redirected locally. Two of them rode into
# b323696 with a merge — neither parent had them — and 325 KB of build
# output then travelled as repository content. The series is local
# evidence of a local run; CI produces its own.
/.check*.log
